&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:58pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:58pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-23pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:31pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;(7) 企業結合が連結会計年度の開始日に完了した場合の当連結会計年度の連結損益計算書に及ぼす影響の概算額及びその算定方法&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:40pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:212.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
